        "TileImage": "$($repository efb0894c-426e-4f66-9822-880d1e735047).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rJordan Cross has requested our assistance in dealing with two persistent problems: a stalker who has become far too close for comfort, and an employee whose negligence has proven exceedingly expensive. Our client believes strongly in efficiency, and wishes both matters resolved discreetly.\r\rThe location is heavily secured, with surveillance coverage throughout the premises, though I trust this presents little challenge for you.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
